，故述往事，思來者。」於是卒述陶唐以來，至于麟止，自黃帝始。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"李陵","kind":"person","person_id":"3tq_5qz_qb9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"西伯","kind":"person","person_id":"yi5_jym_uoz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"屈原","kind":"person","person_id":"e7f_ip0_jk1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"左丘","kind":"person","person_id":"asu_nj9_wb8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"孫子","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_9fp_dpo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"puu_6hs_m4f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0135","start":135,"end":137,"surface":"韓非","kind":"person","person_id":"0ze_qgj_quv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"ocd_ibe_at1","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p013","text":"維昔黃帝，法天則地，四聖遵序，各成法度；唐堯遜位，虞舜不臺；厥美帝功，萬世載之。作五帝本紀第一。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m013-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"ocd_ibe_at1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m013-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"四聖","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m013-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"唐堯","kind":"person","person_id":"0ea_a78_okm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m013-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"虞舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ab2_pxs_34r","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p037","text":"非兵不彊，非德不昌，黃帝、湯、武以興，桀、紂、二世以崩，可不慎歟？司馬法所從來尚矣，太公、孫、吳、王子能紹而明之，切近世，極人變。作律書第三。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m037-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"ocd_ibe_at1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m037-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"0np_0mp_q1l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m037-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"武","kind":"person","person_id":"a8q_r4j_swi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m037-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"91n_mvc_uix","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m037-0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"y3l_45z_mfp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m037-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"二世","kind":"person","person_id":"hem_zeh_251","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m037-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"太公","kind":"person","person_id":"hnu_8zd_5n9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m037-0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"孫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m037-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"吳","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m037-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"王子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p142","text":"維我漢繼五帝末流，接三代絕業。周道廢，秦撥去古文，焚滅詩書，故明堂石室金匱玉版圖籍散亂。於是漢興，蕭何次律令，韓信申軍法，張蒼為章程，叔孫通定禮儀，則文學彬彬稍進，詩書往往閒出矣。自曹參薦蓋公言黃老，而賈生、晁錯明申、商，公孫弘以儒顯，百年之閒，天下遺文古事靡不畢集太史公。太史公仍父子相續纂其職。曰：「於戲！余維先人嘗掌斯事，顯於唐虞，至于周，復典之，故司馬氏世主天官。至於余乎，欽念哉！欽念哉！」罔羅天下放失舊聞，王跡所興，原始察終，見盛觀衰，論考之行事，略推三代，錄秦漢，上記軒轅，下至于茲，著十二本紀，既科條之矣。并時異世，年差不明，作十表。禮樂損益，律歷改易，兵權山川鬼神，天人之際，承敝通變，作八書。二十八宿環北辰，三十輻共一轂，運行無窮，輔拂股肱之臣配焉，忠信行道，以奉主上，作三十世家。扶義俶儻，不令己失時，立功名於天下，作七十列傳。凡百三十篇，五十二萬六千五百字，為太史公書。序略，以拾遺補闕，成一家之言，厥協六經異傳，整齊百家雜語，藏之名山，副在京師，俟後世聖人君子。第七十。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"五帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"蕭何","kind":"person","person_id":"1xf_5a0_n0p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"2nx_tda_i4j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"張蒼","kind":"person","person_id":"796_nkw_0jz_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0067","start":67,"end":70,"surface":"叔孫通","kind":"person","person_id":"axb_hsg_0lj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"曹參","kind":"person","person_id":"diy_04a_wsu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"蓋